 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
-*   **Normalization:** Voxel values and gradients must be normalized between $0$ and $1$ from their underlying representation (e.g., 8-bit) when sampled [S1]. Failure to do so results in incorrect lookup coordinates.
-*   **Boundary Conditions:** The gradient magnitude $g$ is mapped to $[0, 1]$. Ensure that the division by $(kTF2DHeight - 1)$ handles the case where height is 1 (though practically, height > 1) [S2, unofficial].
